Subject: [PATCH] topaz-0129: WLAN ifnet stub (tw0) on radio ready

Expose the 0126 TopazModem C API via <sys/topaz_wlan.h> and attach a
legacy ethernet ifnet `tw0` when the WCN radio reports ready (wifi=1).
No association or data path yet: output drops frames. Lets configd and
kernel code see a MAC and proves the ready hook. Boot-arg sweetwlanif=0
skips the ifnet (API header still available).

